WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
Our lineage and our legacy hails back to Athens,

00:05.280 --> 00:09.240
to Rome, to Philadelphia, to Monticello.

00:09.240 --> 00:12.400
Our ancestors built the cities.

00:12.400 --> 00:14.920
They produced the art and architecture.

00:14.920 --> 00:16.760
They built the industry.

